%% Sequence: Resume render lifecycle with debounce + generation guard.

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant H as "[C-27] usePdfPreview (400ms debounce)"
    participant G as "[C-31] generation counter"
    participant W as "[C-26] typst.worker (Worker)"
    participant FC as "[C-33] getTypstSnippet (font cache)"
    participant TS as "[C-28] snippet.pdf()"
    participant Blob as "[C-29] Blob URL / preview state"

    User->>H: resume/theme prop changes (useEffect re-runs)
    H->>G: increment renderGenerationRef, clearTimeout
    H->>W: setTimeout(400ms) → postMessage({id:generation, ...})
    W->>FC: getTypstSnippet(fontFiles) — Promise.all font fetches
    FC-->>W: cached snippet
    W->>TS: snippet.pdf({mainContent, inputs})
    TS-->>W: Uint8Array bytes
    W->>H: postMessage({id, type:'success', bytes}, [bytes.buffer])
    H->>G: check id === renderGenerationRef.current
    alt id matches
        H->>Blob: createObjectURL(blob), revoke previous, setPreviewBlobUrl
    else id stale
        Note over H: discard, don't update preview
    end
